     category: 'styles',
     description: 'Deck your text with festive Unicode characters. This Christmas font generator combines holiday-themed emoji and decorative letter styles for merry messages.',
     content: 'Christmas text on the internet is less about a specific typeface and more about the constellation of symbols and decorative characters that signal "holiday season." The Unicode snowflake (❄), the Christmas tree (🎄), the wrapped gift (🎁), and Santa himself (🎅) are the visual shorthand that makes text feel festive.\n\nCombine these with decorative letter styles — small caps (ᴍᴇʀʀʏ) for a classic holiday card look, double-struck (𝕞𝕖𝕣𝕣𝕪) for a icy, frosted-letter effect, or circled (ⓜⓔⓡⓡⓨ) for ornament-like lettering — and the result reads as intentionally seasonal.\n\nFor maximum holiday impact, frame your text between decorative dividers like ✦ ❄ ✦ or spell out each letter of "NOEL" with an ornament-style symbol. The Unicode standard includes enough snow-related and holiday-adjacent characters to build an entire festive typographic system without ever leaving the text field.',
